&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own UX strategy for our EU programme end to end, with real judgement over what to prioritise and how, as the market and the team&#39;s shape itself still takes form&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with Product, Engineering, and Data on the ground locally, including wider teams and client-side engineers,bringing user needs into decisions from the start, not added on afterward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use our established research methods to bring real insight into your own design work, and feed what you learn locally back into the wider team&#39;s shared understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow two designers based in London, building one genuinely connected team across EU and the UK from early on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how local work becomes part of our shared platform and design system, so what you build here compounds for every client after, not just this one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build directly in code where useful, using AI-assisted tools to prototype or ship small front-end changes yourself, closing the gap between design and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go beyond representing UX, be an active voice in the trade-offs between PMs and Design, holding the right balance between client-specific needs and our global approach, including directly with clients and stakeholders in workshops, showcases, and pre-sales conversations across the EU market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define what design leadership looks like across a genuinely distributed function, UK, EU, and Australia, while it&#39;s still being built&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record owning UX strategy and delivery end to end for a complex, multi-stakeholder product, ideally in a regulated or operationally complex industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing in B2B or B2B2C environments, for professional, repeat users rather than casual consumers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing or mentoring other designers, comfortable leading a small team while still doing hands-on design work yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working from, and contributing back to, a shared platform or design system, not just consuming one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working close to code, confident using AI-assisted development tools (such as Claude Code) to go from design to a working interface yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine appetite for building something from an early stage, comfortable with ambiguity that comes with shaping a team and a market presence, not just operating inside one already settled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance: &lt;/strong&gt;Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allowances:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% commuting expense reimbursement, €200 Home Working Allowance, and €150 Learning Fund&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday + bank holidays + RTT days, Moments That Matter Leave, Compassionate Leave, two paid Volunteering Days, Flexible Working, and Career Break eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. Our Applicant Data Protection Policy is&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At ASM, we are shaping the future of semiconductor manufacturing through innovation and technology leadership. Our success depends on attracting and hiring exceptional talent across engineering, commercial, service, and leadership functions. We are seeking a highly experienced Senior Talent Acquisition Specialist to join our European Talent Acquisition team and serve as a trusted advisor to senior business leaders across Europe and North America.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Senior Talent Acquisition Specialist, you will lead the end-to-end recruitment of experienced professionals and senior leaders across multiple business functions and geographies. This is a highly visible role requiring exceptional stakeholder management, market intelligence, and proactive sourcing capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will partner closely with senior leaders to identify, attract, and secure top talent in a highly competitive semiconductor market. Success in this role requires a strong executive presence, the ability to influence at all levels, and a proactive, data-driven approach to talent acquisition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is based in Almere and will serve as a key Talent Acquisition partner supporting hiring across Europe and the United States.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
